   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Progress Toward Outcome: Implementation activities have been completed for Area 2 of the Nuku&apos;alofa Network Upgrade Project (NNUP) which was for this project to address. Cost savings and part of contingency sums were committed to acquiring additional materials to complete 100% upgrading works in Area 2 rather than 90% as originally projected. 10% coverage in Area 2 of NNUP was left out at initial project planning due to estimated financing shortfall reasons at that time. (January 2019). By end of June 2020, 2,170 customers in NNUP Area 2 were already connected to the upgraded network compared to the initial target of 1,736. Power supply in NNUP Area 2 is now fully operation with very minimal disruptions in testing phase.</narrative>
    </title>
