   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Status of Implementation Progress: 100% of NNUP Area 2 network has been upgraded and fully operational as at June 2020. 2,170 (target was 1,736) customers have been connected to the upgraded network. Ongoing. Final cleaning up is in progress. Works started in September 2019 once the required materials and equipment arrived into Tonga. Good planning and scheduling of works saw the TPL project team meeting the completion target of June 2020. Public awareness meetings held in each village prior to any site works and consultation notices on media was ongoing within the duration of the project to avoid any unnecessary stoppages to work. Project continued to support gender equality by recruiting and training more female field workers during the project. 33% (target was 30%) of the project workers were females.</narrative>
